<!--
  Storybook is a client-rendered single-page app: every story/docs "page"
  is served from this same index.html and differentiated only by a
  `?path=...` query string handled client-side, so there is exactly one
  crawlable document rather than a page per story. Listing individual
  story query-string URLs here would not add real indexable content and
  would just be noise that goes stale as story IDs change.
-->
